{"id":"0e3663ac78a646a4","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-fm.md","title":"Friedberg–Muchnik 定理","display":"thm-fm — Friedberg–Muchnik 定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-fm","aliases":["20-thm-fm"],"display":"thm-fm — Friedberg–Muchnik 定理","chapter":"7","section":"7.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 7.3.1；Lemmas 7.3.3–7.3.4","source_printed_pages":[152,153,154],"source_pdf_pages":[186,187,188],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]","[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-fm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-fm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fm — Friedberg–Muchnik 定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 7.3.1；Lemmas 7.3.3–7.3.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span><span>153</span><span>154</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>186</span><span>187</span><span>188</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d6ac440f71a3538\" href=\"?note=5d6ac440f71a3538\" title=\"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound\">20-lem-one-action-priority-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用自然数优先序及有效不交见证列；阶段状态由有限数据编码。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d6ac440f71a3538\" href=\"?note=5d6ac440f71a3538\" title=\"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound\">20-lem-one-action-priority-bound</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fm}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A\\not\\le_TB\\land B\\not\\le_TA].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fm}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A\\not\\le_TB\\land B\\not\\le_TA].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>排列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{2e}:\\chi_A\\ne\\Phi_e^B\">\\(R_{2e}:\\chi_A\\ne\\Phi_e^B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{2e+1}:\\chi_B\\ne\\Phi_e^A\">\\(R_{2e+1}:\\chi_B\\ne\\Phi_e^A\\)</span>，无需另假定程序编号的奇偶 padding。每个策略用自己的无限可计算见证列，见证从未被任何先前阶段用过。初始化时丢弃旧见证、清空限制和“已行动”标记；配置新见证时选超出所有更高策略对本侧集合的现有限制的值，其他策略不会枚举其专属见证。</p>\n<p>阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 先为已激活而没有见证的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\le s\">\\(k\\le s\\)</span> 配置见证。随后选最小尚未行动且在当前见证上对方的有界 oracle 计算输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的策略。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=2e\">\\(k=2e\\)</span>，将见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 枚举进 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^{B_s}(x)\">\\(\\Phi_e^{B_s}(x)\\)</span> 的 use 设为对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的限制，并标记已行动；奇数策略交换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span>。每次行动初始化所有较低策略。选择新见证越过较高限制，保证较低策略的枚举不破坏较高已经保存的计算。每个策略每次初始化之间至多行动一次，故上游计数引理保证有限次行动和初始化。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 最后一次初始化之后的见证。若它最终行动，见证成为本侧成员，而对方的零输出计算不再被破坏，满足不同要求。若它永不行动，见证始终不在本侧；假设整体泛函等于本侧特征函数，则该见证的真实输出必为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，其有限计算最终在阶段模拟中出现。所有更高策略已经结束，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 会被选中行动，矛盾。所有要求成立，两个集合的有效枚举给出 c.e. 性。这是原书同一策略的显式见证与双指标版本。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.3.1；Lemmas 7.3.3–7.3.4；印刷页 152, 153, 154；PDF 第 186, 187, 188 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5d6ac440f71a3538","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-one-action-priority-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5d6ac440f71a3